{"title":"달링","artist":"MARETU","sourceId":"reference:wulDekeM7Xiw24RFaMjJ","sourceHash":"07aae258670d087ac6a1e169486d049edeb6f279297426f0a92fef46482e3e22","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":2.75,"end":5.75,"text":"魔法みたいな 夢みたいな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.86,"end":8.36,"text":"ファンタジックな物語が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":8.36,"end":11.25,"text":"世界に感染、愉快に蔓延","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":11.25,"end":14.25,"text":"待って、そんなの聞いてないってば！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":18.96,"end":21.62,"text":"根本的に 痛い異常行動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":21.62,"end":24.29,"text":"支える 枯れない妄想量","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":24.29,"end":27.03,"text":"本能的に 深い破壊衝動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":27.03,"end":29.75,"text":"照らす確かな解像度","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":29.75,"end":32.64,"text":"恋の導火線、いざ 火をともし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":32.64,"end":35.29,"text":"ひとつ、ここらで本調子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":35.29,"end":38.23,"text":"脳細胞に今、叩き込め","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":38.23,"end":41.23,"text":"\"わからないことだらけ\" を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":41.32,"end":42.64,"text":"あざとい、きわどい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":42.64,"end":45.64,"text":"笑わないで。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":46.5,"end":48.08,"text":"いつも いつも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":48.08,"end":51.08,"text":"誤魔化してばっかりね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":52.17,"end":53.72,"text":"いらない、知らない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":53.72,"end":56.72,"text":"おだてないで！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":57.63,"end":60.62,"text":"言えない 消えない思い込め","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":60.62,"end":63.62,"text":"\"愛の強制ミューティレーション！\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":63.71,"end":66.4,"text":"魔法みたいな 夢みたいな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":66.4,"end":68.82,"text":"ファンタジックな物語が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":68.82,"end":71.82,"text":"世界に感染！不快に蔓延！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":71.84,"end":74.57,"text":"待って、こんなの聞いてないって、ダーリン？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":74.57,"end":77.45,"text":"ベターな恋愛 エラーな展開","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":77.45,"end":79.92,"text":"だって、それじゃあつまらないでしょ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":79.92,"end":82.92,"text":"切り抜けて、 惹きつけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":83.02,"end":86.02,"text":"\"愛の顔面ストレート！\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":90.68,"end":93.39,"text":"根本的に まずい異常行動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":93.39,"end":96.1,"text":"支える いかれた情報量","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":96.1,"end":98.83,"text":"圧倒的に 淡い母性本能","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":98.83,"end":101.56,"text":"暴く 飢えた奴隷根性","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":101.56,"end":104.36,"text":"愛の導火線、いざ 火をつけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":104.36,"end":107.19,"text":"頭の中はアルデンテ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":107.19,"end":109.92,"text":"生細胞に今、流し込め","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":109.92,"end":112.92,"text":"\"耐え難いことだらけ\" を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":112.97999999999999,"end":114.58,"text":"冷たい ふれあい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":114.58,"end":117.58,"text":"遊ばないで。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":118.36,"end":119.83,"text":"いつも いつも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":119.83,"end":122.83,"text":"当てつけてばっかりね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":123.93,"end":125.44,"text":"つたない うかがい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":125.44,"end":128.44,"text":"ふざけないで。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":129.47,"end":132.35,"text":"言えない 消えない思い込め","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":132.35,"end":135.35,"text":"\"愛の眼球アイスピック！\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":146.09,"end":149.09,"text":"好きな人 の好きな人ってだけで嫌い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":151.19,"end":154.19,"text":"都合の良い子 演じて一生、終わりたくないんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":156.94,"end":159.94,"text":"狂った未来に迎合、終わった抵抗","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":160.26,"end":162.9,"text":"いっそこのまま目を塞いで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":162.9,"end":165.77,"text":"切って爽快、喰らって崩壊","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":165.77,"end":168.57999999999998,"text":"知って後悔望んだ将来","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":168.57999999999998,"end":171.21,"text":"手を繋いで 場を繋いで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":171.21,"end":173.77,"text":"ファンタジックな すったもんだが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":173.77,"end":176.7,"text":"頭脳に感染！危険に発展！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":176.7,"end":179.35,"text":"待って、こんなの聞いてないって、ダーリン？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":179.35,"end":182.24,"text":"ベターな恋愛 エラーな展開","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":182.24,"end":184.85,"text":"だって、それじゃあつまらないでしょ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":184.85,"end":187.57,"text":"踏み付けて、焼き付けて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":187.57,"end":190.57,"text":"とろけそうな 三叉神経","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":190.57,"end":193.04,"text":"壊れそうな 群居本能","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":193.04,"end":195.87,"text":"崩れそうな 情を前に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":195.87,"end":198.87,"text":"\"愛の脳内レボリューション！\